                "uri": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFx_vLlyXDwc7mdNWJ7MST7UDxOinmx2-Rg98UBMiMNlhRdW87Gc0Pgjnv_OSNTKkumyT10QLzNRGD2FQHxOAU3WIGR8t0xWvk-gzP-FliWvYRCYG69p9LU9cN-wq0LO88RfYjBhdc-ryVPsnfJEhuOP4RH6h9jColgk65YV0Uekc9K2BHSzs_m"
